No login required. The app works entirely offline.

TO TEST THE RAG FEATURES:
1. Launch the app and tap "Add Document" (+ button)
2. Import any PDF or text file from Files app
3. Wait for "Processing complete" notification (~5-10 seconds)
4. Type a question about the document in the chat
5. The app will retrieve relevant passages and generate a cited answer

SAMPLE TEST: Import any PDF from Files. A simple Wikipedia article export works well. Ask questions like "What is the main topic?" or "Summarize the key points."

SUBSCRIPTION TESTING: The Free tier allows 3 documents. Pro features unlock with subscription purchase.

PRIVACY FEATURES: All processing runs on-device by default. The app uses Apple Intelligence (Foundation Models) which may use Private Cloud Compute for complex queries - this is handled automatically by iOS with zero data retention.

NO DEMO CREDENTIALS NEEDED - the app does not require sign-in or account creation.
